// Business Studies (Year 11) — NSW Stage 6, PRELIMINARY COURSE DATA.
// ================================================================
// Full course: 16 modules, 100 lessons across the 3 syllabus
// topics (Nature of Business / Business Management / Business
// Planning), aligned to the NESA Business Studies Stage 6
// Syllabus (2010) — the syllabus that governs the Preliminary
// year through 2027 (new syllabus implements from 2028).
//
// Shape: modules -> lessons -> content blocks (+ a quiz per lesson).
// lessonPreview lists omitted — they auto-hide once `lessons` is filled.
//
// QUESTION TYPES — every quiz item, and every mid-lesson "check" block,
// can use one of four answer formats by setting `type` (quiz items) or
// `qtype` (check blocks — `type` is already used there to mark it as a
// checkpoint). Leaving it out defaults to "mcq".
//
//   mcq (default)  { q, options, correct, explain? }              — tap one option
//   truefalse      { q, correct: true|false, explain? }           — tap True/False
//   multi          { q, options, correct: [i, j], explain? }      — select ALL that apply
//   type           { q, accepted: ["answer", "alt answer"], explain? } — type the answer
//
// Diagram blocks: { type: "diagram", kind: "<kind>" } — each kind matches a
// specification in "Business Studies Y11 — Diagram Specifications (52 Diagrams)".

