              type: "p",
              text: "**Margins** show profit as a proportion of revenue. Gross profit margin = gross profit ÷ revenue: 252,000 ÷ 410,000 ≈ **61.5%**. This means each $1 of sales kept 61.5c after ingredients. Net profit margin = net profit ÷ revenue: 23,800 ÷ 410,000 ≈ **5.8%**."
