                "**Current liabilities** — due within 12 months: creditors/accounts payable, overdraft, short-term loans and tax due.",
                "**Non-current liabilities** — long-term debts such as mortgages and multi-year loans.",
                "**Owner's equity** — capital contributed plus retained, or undistributed, profits. Rearranged, equity = assets − liabilities, which is the business's net worth.",
