              items: [
                "**Interest rate and fees** — These are the direct price of debt finance.",
                "**Collateral and personal risk** — The founder must consider what could be lost if the business fails, including personal property.",
                "**Control** — Equity partners gain decision rights, so the founder gives up some autonomy.",
                "**Repayment inflexibility** — Debt must be repaid on schedule regardless of revenue. This is why debt-heavy establishments can fail during quiet months.",
              ]
